<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adtran raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group said analyst Chandan Sarkar raised his long-term recommendation on Adtran Inc to buy from hold, and left unchanged his short-term buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The analyst's fiscal 1997 earnings estimate of $1.25 per share and fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.64 were also unchanged, SoundView said.</p>
<p>-- Adtran shares were up three to 26-3/4 in afternoon Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
